abstract: >
  QuadVerdict is an open-source, publication-grade benchmark comparing Random
  Forest, Decision Tree, Support Vector Machine, and Logistic Regression on the
  UCI Credit Card Default dataset (N = 30,000) under asymmetric cost-sensitive
  lending losses. Features a 15-fold nested cross-validation protocol, Nadeau-Bengio
  corrected resampled t-tests, Holm-Bonferroni family-wise error control, zero-leakage
  pipeline architecture, and a standalone interactive client dashboard.
